<PolicyLayout title="Booking, cancellations & refunds" description="Our tutoring package, cancellation, rescheduling and refund policies for families.">
  <p>These policies apply to tutoring booked with MyChristianTutors. A parent, guardian or adult student must make the booking and handle payment. Questions? Email <a href="mailto:admin@mychristiantutors.com">admin@mychristiantutors.com</a>. We reply to all emails within 24 hours.</p>

  <h2>Your tutoring package</h2>
  <p>Each package hour pays for one 60-minute online session. The 5-hour package is for one student; 10-hour and 20-hour packages can be shared with up to 3 and 5 students respectively. Your order confirmation lists your students, subjects, tutors and scheduled sessions.</p>
  <p>New bookings require at least 72 hours’ notice before the first session. Sessions normally repeat weekly at the same day and time. Check your chosen time zone and session dates before paying.</p>

  <h2>Refunds and unused hours</h2>
  <p><strong>Tutoring packages are non-refundable, except where required by law.</strong> Changing your mind, cancelling a booking or not using all your hours does not automatically entitle you to a refund. Unused hours remain part of your package; contact admin for help scheduling them.</p>
  <p>If you believe you were charged incorrectly, or we cannot provide the tutoring you purchased, contact admin so we can resolve the issue. Nothing in this policy limits cancellation, refund or other consumer rights that cannot legally be excluded.</p>

  <h2>Changing a day or time</h2>
  <p>Contact your tutor as soon as you know you need a change. Your family and tutor can agree on a different date or time, subject to availability. Please confirm the time zone when discussing a change.</p>
  <p>The tutor should notify admin of the agreed change so admin can update the booking and the tutor’s reserved time. Please copy <a href="mailto:admin@mychristiantutors.com">admin@mychristiantutors.com</a> when possible. A requested change is not confirmed until the tutor agrees and admin records it. Until then, your existing booking remains in place.</p>
  <p>While building your plan, “Skip this week” adds a replacement session at the end. After purchase, arrange skipped weeks and replacement dates with your tutor and admin. A rescheduled session uses the same package hour.</p>

  <h2>Cancellations, missed sessions and late arrivals</h2>
  <p>If you need to cancel a session or stop tutoring, notify both your tutor and admin as soon as possible. Cancelling does not itself create a replacement session or refund; agree on any replacement with your tutor and have admin record it.</p>
  <p>A missed session counts as a used package hour unless your tutor and admin agree to a replacement. If a student arrives late, the session normally ends at the originally scheduled time. We understand that emergencies happen; contact us so we can discuss the circumstances.</p>

  <h2>If your tutor cannot attend</h2>
  <p>If your tutor cancels or cannot provide a session, we will help arrange a replacement date or another suitable tutor with your agreement. You will not lose a package hour for a session the tutor does not provide, and the replacement will not cost an additional hour. Contact admin if we cannot find a suitable arrangement.</p>

  <h2>Joining your session</h2>
  <p>Use the meeting instructions supplied with your booking and allow time to check your connection, microphone and camera. If a technical problem prevents a session, let the tutor and admin know promptly so we can help and agree on next steps.</p>

  <h2>Questions and policy changes</h2>
  <p>Contact <a href="mailto:admin@mychristiantutors.com">admin@mychristiantutors.com</a> about your order or these policies. We may update these terms for future bookings; the policy shown when you purchased applies to that order unless we agree otherwise or a change is required by law. Our <a href="/privacy">Privacy policy</a> explains how we use your information.</p>
</PolicyLayout>
